This criminal illegal alien reportedly assaulted multiple underaged girls and attended 11th grade as an 18-year-old

WASHINGTON – Today, the U.S. Department of Homeland Security (DHS) announced U.S. Immigration and Customs Enforcement (ICE) requested Fairfax County, Virginia sanctuary politicians not to release Israel Christopher Flores-Ortiz, an 18-year-old criminal illegal alien from El Salvador who was arrested for nine counts of assault and battery. According to local reports, this criminal alien groped multiple girls while attending a local high school despite the fact he is an 18-year-old adult. He is accused of repeatedly creeping up behind the students in crowded hallways and grabbing them between the legs.

Flores-Ortiz illegally entered the United States in 2024 and was RELEASED into the country under the Biden administration.

